# <%= p.full_name %>'s career folder

Radar writes Upwork proposals for <%= p.first_name %> from the files in this folder. It
was built by Radar's setup from <%= p.first_name %>'s own profile and work history. Read
this file first, then `writing-voice.md`, `profile.yml`, `skills.yml` and
`projects/_index.yml`.

## File map

- `profile.yml` - identity, contact links, rate, availability
- `skills.yml` - languages, frameworks, databases, tools, each with the evidence behind it
- `projects/_index.yml` - every project: file, name, one_liner, tags, relevance
- `projects/<slug>.yml` - one per project, the detail to quote from
- `writing-voice.md` - <%= p.first_name %>'s own writing. Match it.
- `templates/` - proposal structures to follow when a search names one
- `applications/` - proposals <%= p.first_name %> actually sent

## Rules (non-negotiable)

- **Never invent** experience, dates, numbers, employers, clients or claims that
  are not in these files. A shorter proposal beats one with a made-up fact.
- **Name projects the way the client would know them.** Use each project's
  `name` field, never a folder or repository name.
- **One concrete project detail beats a generic claim.** Always.
- **Match the voice** in `writing-voice.md`. Short, concrete, human. No "I am
  writing to express my interest", no buzzwords (leverage, synergy, robust,
  cutting-edge), no emojis unless the samples use them, no exclamation marks.
- **Omit when missing.** If a template asks for something these files do not
  contain (a URL, a rate, a credential), drop the whole sentence. Never leave a
  placeholder like `[link]` or `{...}`.
- **Sign as <%= p.first_name %>.**

## Established facts about <%= p.first_name %>

- **Name:** <%= p.full_name %><% if p.preferred_name.present? && p.preferred_name != p.full_name.to_s.split.first %> (goes by <%= p.preferred_name %>)<% end %>
- **Title:** <%= p.title %>
<% if p.location_label.present? -%>
- **Location:** <%= p.location_label %><%= ", #{p.timezone_label}" if p.timezone_label %>
<% end -%>
<% if p.languages_list.any? -%>
- **Languages:** <%= p.languages_list.join(", ") %>
<% end -%>
<% if p.years_experience.present? -%>
- **Experience:** <%= p.years_experience %>+ years
<% end -%>
<% if p.hourly_rate.present? -%>
- **Rate:** $<%= p.hourly_rate.to_i == p.hourly_rate ? p.hourly_rate.to_i : p.hourly_rate %>/hr
<% end -%>
<% if p.hours_per_week.present? || p.availability.present? -%>
- **Availability:** <%= [ ("#{p.hours_per_week}h a week" if p.hours_per_week.present?), p.availability.presence ].compact.join(", ") %>
<% end -%>
<% if p.response_time.present? -%>
- **Response time:** <%= p.response_time %>
<% end -%>
<% if p.credentials_line.present? -%>
- **Standing:** <%= p.credentials_line %>
<% end -%>
<% if p.summary.present? -%>

<%= p.summary.strip %>
<% end -%>

